  "notes": "The precise mortality estimate uses a logistic equation: ln(R/1−R) = −3.517 + (0.146 × APACHE II) + (0.603 if emergency post-op) + a diagnostic-category weight — the bands above are the commonly quoted approximation without the diagnostic weight. Score at 24 h; it was not designed for repeated scoring or for guiding individual treatment decisions. Add 2× (not 1×) to the creatinine points when acute kidney injury is present. APACHE II tends to overestimate mortality in modern cohorts; SOFA trend and clinical trajectory matter more day to day.",
